			"notes": "## Additions\n- 1.2.5 support\n- Made Default 1.1 world type accessible on world creation for 1.2.5\n- Snow under leaves and on top of plants\n- Cheaper crafting recipes\n- Stackable signs and doors\n- Optionally remove plank variants from 1.2.5\n- Toggles for hunger, experience and ore tweaks\n- More control over biome height\n- Control over which blocks Endermen can pick up\n\n## Changes\n- Magma cube drops updated to match 1.1\n- 1.1 and 1.2.5 modify the vanilla \"add hills\" layer instead of using a custom version.\n- Changed mixins for better mod compatibility"
		},
